  backgroundMusicClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 44a8d6a31cd2b67489182be50a66fd94, type: 3}
  description: "\rThe Order of Seraphs is deeply religious, holding sacred beliefs
    and striving for virtues. They worship the concept of light rather than a specific
    deity. Fanatics within the order can gain special abilities, such as healing,
    and are defensively inclined, with increased vitality but limited offensive capabilities.
    They harbor a strong aversion towards non-believers in the light. Transforming
    the most devout believers into angels requires Anikani resources, and these angels
    possess the ability to heal."
